{
  "format": "FCM topic for a favourited dish (dishTopic). kind=topic: input {name} -> 'dish-' + the first 16 hex of the SHA-256 of the UTF-8 normalized name. Normalization: NFC, lowercase, drop U+2019 and U+0027, every run of characters outside [a-z0-9] (all non-ASCII letters included: Café -> 'caf', Jalapeño -> 'jalape o', never folded to e/n) becomes one space, trim. Every case is {kind, name, input, expected}; expected is what shared/src (TypeScript) returns for input. JSON null = a value that is present and null. An ABSENT key = undefined / not set: implementations must treat a missing key and an unset field as the same thing, and must not emit null for it. Regenerate with `pnpm --filter @udine/shared vectors`; never hand-edit expected.",
